## Archival documents (PDFs under `materials/`)

The format and dataset PDFs packaged here:

- `materials/PD7400072.pdf`
- `materials/VUSFormat.pdf`
- `materials/VikingSeisDataSetDescription.pdf`
- `materials/VikingASCIIFileDescription.pdf`

were originally distributed by UTIG at:

**http://www-udc.ig.utexas.edu/external/yosio/Viking/**

That site is no longer available (the related pages disappeared after the investigator’s retirement). Copies are included here for scholarly reproducibility of the SEISF decode path. They are not a claim of exclusive ownership. If a rights holder objects, contact the repository maintainers.

## N51SUB listing photograph

`materials/N51SUB.jpg` was **not** part of the public UTIG web distribution above.

It is a photograph, taken by Yukio Yamamoto, of a paper listing of the N51SUB assembly (SEISDT / UNSCR / BOUT) that was obtained during a past visit to UTIG. Included solely to document the Path D derivation.

## Cassette data (not redistributed)

UTIG `vkg.*` 8 mm cassette images are **not** shipped in this repository. Obtain them under the archive’s terms and place them locally under `utig/` for tests.
